      "date": "2026-06-04T11:47:41.000Z",
      "title": "Less than half of directors are independent",
      "body": "Following the recent departure of a director, there is only 1 independent director on the board. The company's board is composed of: 1 independent director. 2 non-independent directors. Non-Executive Independent Director Rudra Patel was the last independent director to join the board, commencing their role in 2024. The company's minority of independent directors is a risk according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2e9d757-6965-4b51-9fa7-1869d59f8b4d",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-06-03T11:29:47.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.25 (vs ₹0.07 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.25 (up from ₹0.07 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹109.8m (up ₹109.0m from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.64m (up ₹1.85m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.5% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 81% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 12% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "46632cb0-b72c-40f5-a3c5-7bdcc231cd85",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-06-01T12:24:00.000Z",
      "title": "Ace Men Engg Works Limited Announces Resignation of Sourabh Gopichand Gaikwad from Independent Director Role, Effective June 01, 2026",
      "body": "Ace Men Engg Works Limited announced that Mr. Sourabh Gopichand Gaikwad (DIN: 10692920) resigned as an Independent Director of the company due to preoccupation, effective from the close of working hours on June 01, 2026. The resignation was noted at the board meeting held on June 01, 2026. Mr. Gaikwad submitted his resignation letter stating the reason as preoccupation and requested the company to file the necessary forms with the Ministry of Corporate Affairs, Registrar of Companies, Ahmedabad in respect of his resignation. The company confirmed that Mr. Gaikwad does not hold directorships or committee memberships in any other listed entities.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
